1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:03,720
The first thing that I'm doing once I'm back home is prepping my breakfast.
回家后我做的第一件事，就是准备早餐。

2
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:09,930
I never have time these days to eat at home but I like to prepare some oats that I can easily eat once I'm at school.
最近我总来不及在家吃，但喜欢先准备好燕麦，到了学校就能方便地吃。

3
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:15,030
Since I am going to be adding whey protein to them I like them to cool down first so that the protein doesn't split.
因为我会加乳清蛋白粉，所以喜欢先让燕麦凉一些，免得加进去后结块或分离。

4
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:19,190
And in the meanwhile once they cool down I'm getting ready.
等它慢慢放凉的时候，我就开始收拾自己。

5
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:35,619
I take a shower every day after my workout but I do not wash my hair every day.
运动后我每天都会洗澡，不过并不是每天都洗头。

6
00:00:35,619 --> 00:00:38,679
But today was a good day and it was very much necessary.
不过今天状态不错，也确实很有必要洗一下。

7
00:00:38,679 --> 00:00:44,380
And I have to say that I feel so fresh and just so much more ready for the day when I'm washing my hair before leaving the house.
不得不说，出门前洗过头，会让我觉得特别清爽，也更准备好迎接这一天。

8
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:47,739
It's crazy what a little self care can do to you.
一点点照顾自己的时间能带来这么大的感受变化，真的挺神奇。

9
00:00:47,739 --> 00:00:51,040
Obviously I cannot take as much time for this as I could on the weekends.
当然，我没法像周末一样在这些事情上花那么多时间。

10
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:57,460
But all in all it's still another bit of me time and it's also a ritual of self appreciation.
不过总的来说，这还是一点属于自己的时间，也是表达对自己认可的一种小仪式。

11
00:01:13,260 --> 00:01:18,039
Another ritual of self care and self appreciation for me is my skincare routine.
对我来说，另一个照顾和认可自己的小仪式，就是护肤步骤。

12
00:01:18,039 --> 00:01:20,800
I have a short but sweet skincare routine in the mornings.
我的晨间护肤步骤很简短。

13
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:31,060
When I worked out when I do work out in the mornings I wash my face with a water based cleanser that's foaming and then I pat my face dry and use a toner and an essence.
早晨运动过的话，我会用起泡的水基洁面产品洗脸，再轻轻拍干，然后用爽肤水和精华水。

14
00:01:31,060 --> 00:01:37,649
On days where I'm not going to the gym I'm not washing my face in the mornings and I'm not using toner I just go right back in with the essence.
不去健身的日子，我早上不做这一套清洁，也不用爽肤水，而是直接用精华水。

15
00:01:37,659 --> 00:01:41,320
This one is the one by beauty of joseon the ginseng essence water.
这款是 Beauty of Joseon 的人参精华水。

16
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:53,130
And then I follow that up with a little bit of moisturizer and spf.
接下来再用一点保湿霜和防晒。

17
00:02:03,419 --> 00:02:13,770
I also had to blow dry it my hair stylist actually told me to avoid air drying my hair after we bleach the red out of it as it would just swell up so much when it's wet and it's more prone to breakage.
我还得吹头发。发型师跟我说，漂掉红色之后尽量别自然晾干，因为头发湿着时会膨胀，也更容易断。

18
00:02:13,780 --> 00:02:20,740
So I should just shorten the amount of time that it's in a fragile state and speed up the process by blow drying and obviously using heat protectant.
所以她建议缩短头发处于脆弱状态的时间，用吹风加快干燥，当然也要用隔热产品。

19
00:02:20,740 --> 00:02:27,380
I'm using olaplex number nine which I love and then it's just a real quick process of blow drying my hair.
我用的是喜欢的 Olaplex 九号，接着很快把头发吹干。

20
00:02:31,180 --> 00:02:33,220
Once I'm done it's time to pick out an outfit.
做完这些，就该挑今天的穿搭了。

21
00:02:33,220 --> 00:02:37,000
And it's finally springtime you guys it's starting to feel like it.
终于到春天了，大家！现在也终于开始有春天的感觉。

22
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:42,159
The weather in berlin has been super bad these past few weeks and it did in fact not feel like spring.
过去几周柏林天气很差，确实一点也不像春天。

23
00:02:42,159 --> 00:02:47,570
But now we're getting a little bit better I can almost taste summer I'm telling you.
不过现在在慢慢好转，我仿佛都能尝到夏天的味道了，真的。

24
00:03:05,220 --> 00:03:11,380
Makeup I'm really not doing a lot and I do have a makeup look up on my channel so if you're interested into that just go and check that one out.
至于化妆，我做得并不多。频道里有一个妆容视频，感兴趣的话可以去看看。

25
00:03:11,380 --> 00:03:14,089
On the daily I like my makeup to be simple and easy.
平时我喜欢让妆容简单、容易完成。

26
00:03:14,099 --> 00:03:23,740
However we do not have to wear a mask anymore in clinic unless we're working on a patient which means that putting on face makeup finally what makes it a little bit more sense again.
不过按当时的诊所规定，除非在给病人操作，否则不用一直戴口罩了，所以涂面部彩妆又更有意义了。

27
00:03:23,740 --> 00:03:33,039
On days where I am super rushed I will not wear makeup or I will minimize everything which usually means concealer and bronzer only but those days are pretty rare to come by.
特别赶的时候，我会不化妆或把步骤减到最少，通常只用遮瑕和修容，不过这种日子不太多。

28
00:03:33,039 --> 00:03:38,680
I don't wear makeup to feel more pretty it makes me feel like I'm in a work mode just like putting on my scrubs at dental school.
我化妆并不是为了觉得自己更漂亮，而是为了进入工作状态，就像在牙科学校穿上工作服一样。

29
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:47,410
Makeup free days are days at home and makeup days are days at school that's how my brain is wired at this point I don't know.
不化妆的日子是在家，化妆的日子是在学校。我的脑子现在就是这样建立联系的吧，我也说不清。

30
00:03:50,640 --> 00:03:58,479
And the last thing before leaving the house is finishing up my oats which is super easy just add some whey protein and whatever toppings that you like.
出门前最后一件事，就是把燕麦配好，非常简单，加上蛋白粉和自己喜欢的配料就行。

31
00:03:58,479 --> 00:04:05,680
And voila that's it quick and easy can be transported and eat wherever and whenever.
这样就做好了，方便又快捷，还可以带走，随时随地吃。
